<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WEST TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WEST TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, California 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>Bank of the West Classic women's tennis tournament on Tuesday:</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>6-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Siobhan Drake Brockman</p>
<p>(Australia) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>7-Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Miriam Schnitzer (Germany) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Jana Nejedly (Canada) 6-0</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Rita Grande (Italy) beat Olga Barabanschikova (Belarus) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Sandra Cacic (U.S.) beat Ann Grossman (U.S.) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Meilen Tu (U.S.) beat Erika deLone (U.S.) 7-5 5-7 6-0</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat Naoko Kijimuta (Japan) 4-6 6-0 6-0</p>
</text>
